HTTP Headers
HTTP headers su metadata HTTP poruke. Oni nisu ni URL, ni method, ni body; oni prenose dodatne informacije o requestu ili response-u.
Najjednostavniji mentalni model:
HTTP REQUEST

POST /api/bookings HTTP/1.1
Host: example.com
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer abc123
User-Agent: Mozilla/5.0

{
    "room_id": 15
}

Ovde su:
POST                    → method
/api/bookings           → target

Host
Content-Type
Accept
Authorization
User-Agent              → HEADERS

{ "room_id": 15 }       → body

HTTP header ime je case-insensitive; konceptualno Content-Type i content-type predstavljaju isti header. HTTP/2+ alati ih često prikazuju lowercase.

--------------------------------------------

Request headers vs Response headers
Prvo ih jasno razdvojimo.
Request headers
Klijent ih šalje serveru:
GET /api/rooms HTTP/1.1
Host: example.com
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer abc123
User-Agent: Mozilla/5.0

Server iz njih saznaje dodatni kontekst requesta.
Response headers
Server ih šalje nazad:
HTTP/1.1 200 OK
Content-Type: application/json
Cache-Control: no-cache
X-Request-Id: abc-123

{"data":[]}

Dakle:
CLIENT → SERVER
request headers

SERVER → CLIENT
response headers

-----------------------------------------------

Authorization
Jedan od najvažnijih request headera za API-je:
Authorization: Bearer abc123xyz

Authorization header služi da klijent pošalje credentials za pristup zaštićenom resursu. MDN Web Docs
Najčešći API mentalni model:
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

Na primer:
GET /api/user
Authorization: Bearer eyJ...
Accept: application/json

Server:
uzmi token
↓
proveri ga
↓
identifikuj korisnika
↓
dozvoli ili odbij request

----------------------------------------------

Bearer token u core PHP-u
Možeš prvo pročitati header:
$headers = getallheaders();

$authorization =
    $headers['Authorization']
    ?? null;

Recimo dobiješ:
Bearer abc123

Možeš:
if (
    $authorization !== null
    && str_starts_with(
        $authorization,
        'Bearer '
    )
) {
    $token = substr(
        $authorization,
        7
    );
}

Jer:
"Bearer "

ima 7 karaktera.

Ali u frameworku obično ide automatsko parsiranje.

------------------------------------------------

Laravel pandan
Laravel:
$authorization =
    $request->header('Authorization');

ili direktno:
$token =
    $request->bearerToken();

Laravel header() vraća vrednost request headera, hasHeader() proverava njegovo postojanje, a bearerToken() izvlači Bearer token iz Authorization headera.

---------------------------------------------------

Response headeri u core PHP-u
Za slanje response headera koristiš:
header(
    'Content-Type: application/json'
);

Možeš i:
header(
    'Cache-Control: no-store'
);

ili custom:
header(
    'X-Request-ID: abc-123'
);

Pa body:
echo json_encode([
    'message' => 'OK',
]);

Konceptualni response:
HTTP/1.1 200 OK
Content-Type: application/json
Cache-Control: no-store
X-Request-ID: abc-123

{"message":"OK"}

---------------------------------------------------

Veoma važna PHP zamka — headers must come before output
Ovo:
echo 'Hello';

header(
    'Content-Type: application/json'
);

može dati čuvenu grešku:
Cannot modify header information -
headers already sent

Zašto?
Jer je PHP već počeo da šalje response body klijentu, a HTTP headers moraju prethoditi body-ju.
PHP dokumentacija naglašava da header(), setcookie() i session funkcije koje dodaju headere moraju biti korišćene pre nego što output počne. PHP
Zato:
header(
    'Content-Type: application/json'
);

echo json_encode($data);

a ne obrnuto.

------------------------------------------------ MAPA HEADERS-a ------------------------------------

| Header                    | Glavna svrha |
|------------------------------------------
| `Content-Type`            | format body-ja |
| `Accept`                  | željeni response format |
| `Authorization`           | authentication credentials |
| `Host`                    | ciljani hostname |
| `User-Agent`              | client software |
| `Accept-Language`         | jezičke preference |
| `Cookie`                  | cookies koje client šalje |
| `Set-Cookie`              | server postavlja cookie |
| `Location`                | redirect target |
| `Cache-Control`           | caching pravila |
| `Origin`                  | origin requesta / CORS |
| `Referer`                 | prethodna stranica |

SERVER

WWW-Authenticate:
Bearer ...

        ↓

CLIENT

Authorization:
Bearer token


Content negotiation:

CLIENT

Accept:
application/json

        ↓

SERVER

Content-Type:
application/json

---

REQUEST

method + URL
HEADERS
body

---

RESPONSE

status
HEADERS
body

---

Content-Type
→ šta ŠALJEM

Accept
→ šta želim da DOBIJEM

Authorization
→ credentials

User-Agent
→ client info

Host
→ koji host tražim

---

PHP

// svi request headers
$headers = getallheaders();

// određeni server-normalized header
$_SERVER['HTTP_USER_AGENT'];

// šaljem response header
header(
    'Content-Type: application/json'
);

// response headers koje sam pripremio
headers_list();

// da li je output već počeo
headers_sent();

LARAVEL 

$request->header('Authorization');

$request->hasHeader(
    'Authorization'
);

$request->bearerToken();

$request->accepts(
    'application/json'
);

$request->expectsJson();

return response($body)
    ->header(
        'Content-Type',
        'text/plain'
    );


ZAMKA:

header()
MORA pre outputa

inače dobijaš:
headers already sent